{
  "findings": [
    {
      "id": "autoloader-generic",
      "level": "warn",
      "places": [],
      "lines": [
        "The app ships no composer/autoload.php, so the server registers its generic loader for lib/ and looks every class up in the file system.",
        "  A composer/composer.json with config.vendor-dir \".\", config.optimize-autoloader true, a config.autoloader-suffix and autoload.psr-4 {\"OCA\\\\ProfileFields\\\\\": \"../lib/\"} makes composer dump-autoload write composer/autoload.php with a class map; the code of the app does not change."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "autoloader-authoritative",
      "level": "warn",
      "places": [
        "composer.json: config.classmap-authoritative"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "The Composer autoloader is optimized beyond level 1. The manual allows only config.optimize-autoloader: an authoritative class map breaks the upgrade of the app, and APCu is no required extension.",
        "  composer.json: config.classmap-authoritative"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "boot-listener",
      "level": "warn",
      "places": [
        "lib/AppInfo/Application.php:58 injectFn()"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "boot() registers a listener or takes a service from the container in 1 place. boot() runs once for every process of the server, so each of them is built on every request. registerEventListener() in register() builds a listener only when its event fires.",
        "  lib/AppInfo/Application.php:58 injectFn()"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "transaction-manual",
      "level": "info",
      "places": [
        "lib/Service/DataImportService.php:54"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "1 transaction is opened and closed by hand. The trait TTransactional has atomic() since Nextcloud 24 and atomicRetry() since Nextcloud 27, which repeats a transaction that ran into a deadlock, as the manual recommends.",
        "  lib/Service/DataImportService.php:54"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "time-direct",
      "level": "info",
      "places": [
        "lib/Service/FieldDefinitionService.php:39 new DateTime()",
        "lib/Service/FieldDefinitionService.php:87 new DateTime()",
        "lib/Service/FieldValueService.php:494 new DateTime()",
        "lib/Workflow/NotifyAdminsOrGroupsProfileFieldChangeOperation.php:103 new DateTime()",
        "lib/Workflow/SendWebhookProfileFieldChangeOperation.php:81 new DateTimeImmutable()"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "lib/ reads the clock directly in 5 places. OCP\\AppFramework\\Utility\\ITimeFactory, a PSR-20 ClockInterface, gives the same time and can be replaced in a test.",
        "  lib/Service/FieldDefinitionService.php:39 new DateTime()",
        "  lib/Service/FieldDefinitionService.php:87 new DateTime()",
        "  lib/Service/FieldValueService.php:494 new DateTime()",
        "  lib/Workflow/NotifyAdminsOrGroupsProfileFieldChangeOperation.php:103 new DateTime()",
        "  lib/Workflow/SendWebhookProfileFieldChangeOperation.php:81 new DateTimeImmutable()"
      ],
      "folds": [
        {
          "at": 4,
          "count": 2
        }
      ]
    }
